parent\"></div><div class=\"container py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"max-w-xl rounded-3xl bg-slate-950/55 p-6 ring-1 ring-white/10 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-8\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"font-display text-4xl font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-white md:text-5xl\">Покритие</h1><p class=\"mt-4 text-lg text-white/85\">Собствен транспорт от Манчестър до България — всеки петък. Последна миля с Еконт до всяко населено място в страната.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"container py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-truck h-6 w-6\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"></path><path d=\"M15 18H9\"></path><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\">Собствен курс Манчестър → България</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-muted-fg\">Превозваме сами, със собствен бус, всеки петък — и пратката е в България само за 2–3 дни. Без подизпълнители: колетът ви е в наши ръце по целия път.</p></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package-check h-6 w-6\"><path d=\"m16 16 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l2-1.14\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path><polyline points=\"3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg></div><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-display text-xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\">Доставка с Еконт до цяла България</h2><p class=\"mt-2 text-muted-fg\">След пристигане предаваме на Еконт за последна миля — до всеки град и село в страната.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-full items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/40 p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent/15 text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-store h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m2 7 4.41-4.41A2 2 0 0 1 7.83 2h8.34a2 2 0 0 1 1.42.59L22 7\"></path><path d=\"M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8\"></path><path d=\"M15 22v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h20\"></path><path d=\"M22 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 16 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 12 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 8 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 4 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground\">4 офиса в Обединеното кралство</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Манчестър (2 офиса), Бърнли и Куинсфери — предайте колета където ви е удобно.</p></div></div></div><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-full items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-muted/40 p-6\"><div class=\"flex h-11 w-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent/15 text-accent\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package-check h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m16 16 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l2-1.14\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path><polyline points=\"3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-base font-bold text-foreground\">До офис на Еконт</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Получаване от избран от вас офис на Еконт в избрания град.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-14\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground\">Градове, които обслужваме</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-sm text-muted-fg\">Това са само част от по-големите дестинации — доставяме навсякъде.</p><div class=\"mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"flex h-full items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-4 shadow-soft transition-shadow hover:shadow-lift\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-50 text-brand-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"